steps:
Connect the Flow input node to a Prompt node. Configure the prompt with a small model and this text:
Summarize the following text in two sentences for a busy manager:
{{document}}

Save these five lines as lab-eval.jsonl:
{"prompt": "What is the capital of Australia?", "referenceResponse": "Canberra"}
{"prompt": "Name the largest planet in the solar system.", "referenceResponse": "Jupiter"}
{"prompt": "Explain in one sentence what photosynthesis is.", "referenceResponse": "Plants use light, water, and carbon dioxide to make sugar and oxygen."}
{"prompt": "Give one tip for writing a clear email.", "referenceResponse": "State the purpose in the first sentence."}
{"prompt": "What is 15 percent of 200?", "referenceResponse": "30"}
